      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.6;color:#e7e2f7;margin:16px 0 0;max-width:34em;text-wrap:pretty;">Built by and for POAP KINGS, Elixir keeps the clan honest, organized, and remembered — publishing our data, running the weekly Elder Standing, telling the clan's story, and coaching every member. If you've seen a number on this site, Elixir put it there.</p>
