    <p style="font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;color:#c8c1e6;margin:16px 0 0;max-width:52em;text-wrap:pretty;">Elixir pairs a <strong style="color:#fff;">deterministic data engine</strong> with an <strong style="color:#fff;">LLM awareness loop</strong>. Clash Royale data flows through a single API ingress into append-only receipts and durable event streams — and <strong style="color:#fff;">code, not the model, owns every promotion, demotion, and kick</strong>. A cheap model gates the expensive one on the post-or-stay-quiet call, which cut running cost by roughly 10×.</p>
